name: Sprott D
family: Flows
desc: One of J. C. Sprott's 19 simplest chaotic flows (case D) — five terms, one or two nonlinearities.
ref: J. C. Sprott, "Some simple chaotic flows", Phys. Rev. E 50 (1994)
tags: flow, sprott, 3d
dt: 0.02
ic: 0.11 0.08 0.14
camera: 25 20 0 1



dx = -y
dy = x + z
dz = x*z + 3*y^2
